│      - deny or approve a dispute claim,                                                                 │
│      - flag transactions,                                                                               │
│      - escalate for AML/compliance review,                                                              │
│      - file required regulatory reports where appropriate.                                              │
│                                                                                                         │
│ 7. Resolution and monitoring                                                                            │
│    - The customer is informed of next steps and expected timelines.                                     │
│    - The account may be monitored for repeat suspicious behavior.                                       │
│    - Follow-up controls or remediation are applied.                                                     │
│                                                                                                         │
│ 8. Audit and compliance documentation                                                                   │
